e=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_image_or_svg.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wd-image text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2050\" height=\"2048\" src=\"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05.jpg 2050w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-801x800.jpg 801w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-768x767.jpg 768w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-2048x2046.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-430x430.jpg 430w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/t05-700x699.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2050px) 100vw, 2050px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa19a2a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fa19a2a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36e4bdc text-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_text_block\" data-id=\"36e4bdc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_text_block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-text-block reset-last-child text-left\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2><em>Sakura Industries Verified Quality<\/em><\/h2><p>Our Sakura Industries logo is a symbol for Verified Quality. This mark is proof of a lifetime guarantee.<\/p><p>Every Sakura Industries instrument must pass detailed Quality Assurance (QA) tests before it can be sold.<br \/>Instruments are tested for:<\/p><ul><li>Material<\/li><li>Workmanship<\/li><li>Function<\/li><li>Pattern Consistency<\/li><li>Critical Dimensions<\/li><\/ul><p>We perform the following QA tests to ensure that every instrument we sell will perform its function during critical surgical procedures.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wd-negative-gap elementor-element elementor-element-6bdb6c5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6bdb6c5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-871c973 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"871c973\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8bf8122 text-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_text_block\" data-id=\"8bf8122\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_text_block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-text-block reset-last-child text-left\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2><em>Surface Inspection<\/em><\/h2><p>All instruments are visually inspected for defects in material and surface finish.\u00a0 They must have a flawless satin finish and be free of excess lubricants and foreign substances.<\/p><h2><em>Dimensions Verified<\/em><\/h2><p><br \/>Critical dimensions are measured with calipers, micrometers, or other specialty gauges and compared to technical drawings or Sakura Industries catalog descriptions.\u00a0 To ensure pattern consistency selected instruments are compared to inspection samples.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<